Not done / notes: `tools/gateboss.mjs` references its node-side `CFG` inside the page context, so it threw `ReferenceError: CFG is not defined` before any of my code ran; since the gate is off-limits I published the L3 phase-2 attack name as a page global (`window.CFG = { level: 3, p1: [...], p2: 'surge', ... }`) — that global is the only reason the gate can run at all, and it now makes `gate4.mjs` report FAIL lines instead of erroring (stage 4 is unfinished at baseline: `rotCount=0`). No commit made.
